WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.220
This is Optional Reality.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.975
You don't control the ball.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
You change the rules of its world.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.155
Write a change, then choose when to send it.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.620
Brake the drift, keep the momentum,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:14.760
and find your way home.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.260
Make surfaces bouncier, and turn a collision into a new direction.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.080
The physics and three-star finishes are real.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.195
Meet the toaster.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.680
Power it up, store energy on contact,

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.620
then launch the loaf toward the exit.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.755
Write in any language supported by Google Gemini.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:43.940
Change the rules.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.980
Choose the moment.
